RecompOne change for MediEvilRecomp ITA: G-buffer for slang shaders.
Adds two textures to the shader chain: "Albedo" (texture color without the vertex color) and
"Shading" (vertex color, 0.5 = neutral, triangle id in alpha), plus "GbufferAvailable".
Drawn only when the active shader samples them. GL 3.3+ backends only.
Author: https://github.com/Leproide
License of this change: GPL-3.0-or-later (RecompOne code itself keeps its own license).
Apply from the MediEvilRecomp ITA folder, after cd-whole-sector-mode.patch:
  git -C RecompOne apply ../recompone-fixes/shader-gbuffer.patch

